# Reusable .cursorignore — copy to a repo root as `.cursorignore`
# Applies to local Agent/Tab/@ and to Cloud Agents (when committed).
#
# Cursor already ignores a lot by default (node_modules, .env*, lockfiles,
# images, common build dirs). This file adds the extras that still burn
# context in data/ML and app repos. Trim lines you need Agent to see.
#
# Re-include a small fixture with:  !path/to/small-fixture.csv

# --- Secrets (belt + suspenders; many already default-ignored) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/credentials.json
**/credentials.*.json
**/secrets.json
**/secret.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_dsa
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/
**/.gcloud/

# --- Agent / local scratch (never useful as code context) ---
**/.scratch/
**/scratch/
**/tmp/
**/.tmp/
**/.cache/
**/agent-tools/
**/recordings/

# --- Dependencies & virtualenvs ---
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/.tox/
**/.direnv/

# --- Build / generated ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/
**/coverage/
**/htmlcov/
**/*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/npm-debug.log*

# --- Large data (common in DS / GIS / ML repos) ---
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.parquet
**/*.feather
**/*.arrow
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.geojson
**/*.gpkg
**/*.shp
**/*.shx
**/*.dbf
**/*.tif
**/*.tiff
**/*.hdf5
**/*.h5
**/*.nc
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.7z
**/*.gz
**/*.bz2

# --- Models / weights / pickles ---
**/*.pkl
**/*.pickle
**/*.joblib
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors
**/*.gguf
**/checkpoints/
**/wandb/
**/mlruns/
**/lightning_logs/

# --- Bulky docs / office (prefer links; negate if Agent must edit) ---
**/*.pdf
**/*.pptx
**/*.ppt
**/*.docx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls

# --- Media (photos, video, design) ---
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.psd
**/*.ai
**/*.raw
**/*.raf
**/*.dng
**/*.heic
**/*.CR2
**/*.NEF

# --- Optional: lockfiles (already often default-ignored; uncomment if needed) ---
# **/package-lock.json
# **/pnpm-lock.yaml
# **/yarn.lock
# **/uv.lock
# **/poetry.lock
